==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*4 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Blockers]] like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus]] and [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]] break this stage, bring them if you have have them. If not, bring [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Immune]] meatshields like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Mohawk]] and use powerful hitters/nukers to take care of Bore Jr., such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. Use long range units that have a range of 420 or more to deal with the Gobble, as well as Cats with [[:Category:Cats with Curse ability|Curse]] or [[:Category:Cats with Toxic Immunity|Immune to Toxic]].

